From: local
Subject: [PATCH] functionalgaps+pertag adapted for dwm 6.8 + prior patches

Per-tag layout/nmaster/mfact/showbar and functional gaps with
toggle/reset. Merged createmon with appicons tag_icons init.
Keeps barpadding geometry in togglebar.

